# The DistilBERT challenger re-scorer (EC2 #3, CPU, no ingress). It is item 3 on the
# ordered cut list, so it resolves into its own lock and is installed by nothing else: a
# machine where the challenger has been cut needs neither onnxruntime nor tokenizers, and
# `tests/unit/test_challenger.py` proves the code agrees.
#
# Both compiled wheels below publish manylinux aarch64 distributions, which the serving
# fleet (t4g Graviton, us-west-2) requires and which `--only-binary=:all:` would otherwise
# turn into a source build inside the image.
-r base.txt
onnxruntime==1.19.2
tokenizers==0.20.3
SQLAlchemy==2.0.36
psycopg[binary]==3.2.3
